{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13203320","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13203320","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1320332001:1":{"text":"너어, 너희! 내가 다 들었어! 또 자작님의 성함을 마음대로 부른 거지!","source_cn":"我听到了！你，你们！又在直呼子爵先生的姓名！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x14EC8E0F04F4950D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1320332002:1":{"text":"꼭 루보미르 자작님! 하고 붙여서 불러야 할 것 아니야!","source_cn":"你们应该称呼他为子爵先生！或者子爵阁下！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x87467CD634983A9D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1320332003:1":{"text":"...본인도 신경 쓰지 않는걸... 왜 자꾸 우리에게...","source_cn":"……他自己都不在意，你为什么非要纠正我们啊？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x22E8DD392C4F6131","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1320332004:1":{"text":"흥, 작은 햄스터 따위가 귀족의 명예를 이해할 리 없지!","source_cn":"哼！小小仓鼠，哪里懂得贵族的荣耀！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x68F5B09EFA071395","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1320332005:1":{"text":"루보미르 자작님의 그 지위는 독보적인 영광이라고!","source_cn":"先生的子爵之位，可是独一无二的荣誉！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x128A79E1A9EB1B99","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1320332006:1":{"text":"루보미르가 생전의 그 나이에 자작 지위를 얻은 건 대단하긴 해요. 하지만 그렇게 과장할 정도인가요?","source_cn":"虽然以柳博米尔生前的年龄来说，他能获得子爵之位确实很厉...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB3F19E50CC3A29EF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1320332007:1":{"text":"과장이라니! 루보미르 자작님이 어떻게 자작이 되신 줄 알아?","source_cn":"一点也不夸张！你们知道先生为什么会获得子爵之位吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7DC9576D2068F272","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1320332008:1":{"text":"...바로! 루보미르 자작님이 예술 분야에서 올린 성취 덕분이지!","source_cn":"——是因为先生在艺术方面的成就！！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBEF0B68BCF504996","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1320332009:1":{"text":"전쟁도, 공로도 없었지만, 단지 예술적 재능만으로 자작이 되신 거야! 이게 얼마나 큰 영광인지 알기나 해?","source_cn":"没有战绩，没有功勋，仅仅是因为先生高超的艺术造诣！你们...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0AFA157427F01C66","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1320332010:1":{"text":"레오프론 제국 전체에서도 이런 영예를 얻은 건 루보미르 자작님뿐이야! 그러니까 모두 마음속 깊이 존경해야 한다고!","source_cn":"即使是在整个耀光帝国，也只有先生获得过这般荣誉！所以每...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5D95FD342C3928F6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1320332011:1":{"text":"잠깐, 가지 마. 내 말 아직 안 끝났다고!","source_cn":"等等，你们别走——我还没说完！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE0CAECA60B02DB76","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:烛台守卫":{"text":"촛대 수비병","source":"烛台守卫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":12,"localized_text_count":11,"speaker_count":3}}